#: ../../source/api_RetryHandler.md:1
msgid "Class: RetryHandler"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/api_RetryHandler.md:3
msgid "Extends: `undici.DispatcherHandlers`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/api_RetryHandler.md:5
msgid "A handler class that implements the retry logic for a request."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/api_RetryHandler.md:7
msgid "`new RetryHandler(dispatchOptions, retryHandlers, [retryOptions])`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/api_RetryHandler.md:9
msgid "Arguments:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/api_RetryHandler.md:11
msgid ""
"**options** `Dispatch.DispatchOptions & RetryOptions` (required) - It is "
"an intersection of `Dispatcher.DispatchOptions` and `RetryOptions`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/api_RetryHandler.md:12
msgid ""
"**retryHandlers** `RetryHandlers` (required) - Object containing the "
"`dispatch` to be used on every retry, and `handler` for handling the "
"`dispatch` lifecycle."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/api_RetryHandler.md:14
msgid "Returns: `retryHandler`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/api_RetryHandler.md:16
msgid "Parameter: `Dispatch.DispatchOptions & RetryOptions`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/api_RetryHandler.md:18
msgid ""
"Extends: [`Dispatch.DispatchOptions`](/docs/docs/api/Dispatcher.md"
"#parameter-dispatchoptions)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/api_RetryHandler.md:20
msgid "`RetryOptions`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/api_RetryHandler.md:22
msgid ""
"**throwOnError** `boolean` (optional) - Disable to prevent throwing error"
" on last retry attept, useful if you need the body on errors from server "
"or if you have custom error handler."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/api_RetryHandler.md:23
msgid ""
"**retry** `(err: Error, context: RetryContext, callback: (err?: Error | "
"null) => void) => number | null` (optional) - Function to be called after"
" every retry. It should pass error if no more retries should be "
"performed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/api_RetryHandler.md:24
msgid ""
"**maxRetries** `number` (optional) - Maximum number of retries. Default: "
"`5`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/api_RetryHandler.md:25
msgid ""
"**maxTimeout** `number` (optional) - Maximum number of milliseconds to "
"wait before retrying. Default: `30000` (30 seconds)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/api_RetryHandler.md:26
msgid ""
"**minTimeout** `number` (optional) - Minimum number of milliseconds to "
"wait before retrying. Default: `500` (half a second)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/api_RetryHandler.md:27
msgid ""
"**timeoutFactor** `number` (optional) - Factor to multiply the timeout by"
" for each retry attempt. Default: `2`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/api_RetryHandler.md:28
msgid ""
"**retryAfter** `boolean` (optional) - It enables automatic retry after "
"the `Retry-After` header is received. Default: `true`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/api_RetryHandler.md:30
msgid ""
"**methods** `string[]` (optional) - Array of HTTP methods to retry. "
"Default: `['GET', 'PUT', 'HEAD', 'OPTIONS', 'DELETE']`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/api_RetryHandler.md:31
msgid ""
"**statusCodes** `number[]` (optional) - Array of HTTP status codes to "
"retry. Default: `[429, 500, 502, 503, 504]`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/api_RetryHandler.md:32
msgid ""
"**errorCodes** `string[]` (optional) - Array of Error codes to retry. "
"Default: `['ECONNRESET', 'ECONNREFUSED', 'ENOTFOUND', "
"'ENETDOWN','ENETUNREACH', 'EHOSTDOWN', 'UND_ERR_SOCKET']`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/api_RetryHandler.md:34
msgid "**`RetryContext`**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/api_RetryHandler.md:36
msgid "`state`: `RetryState` - Current retry state. It can be mutated."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/api_RetryHandler.md:37
msgid ""
"`opts`: `Dispatch.DispatchOptions & RetryOptions` - Options passed to the"
" retry handler."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/api_RetryHandler.md:39
msgid "**`RetryState`**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/api_RetryHandler.md:41
msgid "It represents the retry state for a given request."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/api_RetryHandler.md:43
msgid "`counter`: `number` - Current retry attempt."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/api_RetryHandler.md:45
msgid "Parameter `RetryHandlers`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/api_RetryHandler.md:47
msgid ""
"**dispatch** `(options: Dispatch.DispatchOptions, handlers: "
"Dispatch.DispatchHandler) => Promise<Dispatch.DispatchResponse>` "
"(required) - Dispatch function to be called after every retry."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/api_RetryHandler.md:48
msgid ""
"**handler** Extends "
"[`Dispatch.DispatchHandler`](/docs/docs/api/Dispatcher.md"
"#dispatcherdispatchoptions-handler) (required) - Handler function to be "
"called after the request is successful or the retries are exhausted."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/api_RetryHandler.md:50
msgid ""
"__Note__: The `RetryHandler` does not retry over stateful bodies (e.g. "
"streams, AsyncIterable) as those, once consumed, are left in a state that"
" cannot be reutilized. For these situations the `RetryHandler` will "
"identify the body as stateful and will not retry the request rejecting "
"with the error `UND_ERR_REQ_RETRY`."
msgstr ""

